post-renderer">I saw the same swastika style marking on the forehead of Pre=
sident Joe Biden while making a trip to meet with my lawyers the day before=
 Thanksgiving (11/23/2023 - my late mom's birthday) last week in Chicago. T=
he first anti-Semitic images were put up near the shelter I stayed at withi=
n a few weeks of my arrival into Chicago in April/May of 2023 (recall, I le=
ft Florida on a flight through Atlanta getting into the custody of UNICEF i=
n a wheel chair). I was unable to go out to get groceries that day due to r=
e-routing and closures of the CTA/Red Line subway system over apparent viol=
ent threats to passengers. When I walked back to the bus stop to go home in=
stead, I encountered (not unsurprisingly) a protest of a few Middle Eastern=
 men with signs (Fuck Biden image) and loud rap music blaring: "Free, free =
Palestine!" I honestly wonder if this was because of the videos and files (=
github/maxieds/public-file-stashes - see non-main branches) I posted that w=
eek, or otherwise because I have finally gotten in touch with much needed l=
egal resources in Chicago. The last time I came close to getting legal advi=
ce on my since badly broken and hacked AndroidGo phone, a bomb threat was c=
alled into the Chicago Public Library where I had reserved a private space =
to make the phone calls.=20

I have supported the Ukraine with messages in the pull requests to github/e=
msec/ChameleonMini for the DESFire emulation support. The day after I did t=
hat for the first time in 2022, a Russian oligarch was featured on CNN on m=
y ROKU television feed wanting to know (as in directing the question at me)=
 if I knew what the war in Ukraine was really about. Genocide and ant-Semit=
ism (hate groups and speech, in general) are unacceptable across the board =
- no question. China backed the special operations mission into South Ameri=
ca last year and they are known allies of Asian nations. I have speculated =
for a while that the distinctly anti-Russia rhetoric of the war in Ukraine =
is what was needed to get this topic into mainstream coverage in the pro-Tr=
ump (state media) dominated news in the US/USA. The same style of hate symb=
olism used on both Putin and Biden's images this year (2023) suggest that m=
y intuition is correct here.=20

The NPR and CNN/Fareed-GPS podcasts the last month or two have led to my ob=
servable annoyance listening to Iranian hate artists go on about their toil=
s and support making individuals social pariahs over being so-termed "self-=
hating Jews" (F-UCK you, Jasper/Jafar, and the G-dDamn accent, man!) If you=
 listen carefully to these pleas that somehow make it into mainstream news =
coverage in the USA without discussion or summary from anchors, what they a=
re saying is intended to confuse. Yet another example of the Fox News style=
 assault on listeners who just want the key bullet points of the discussion=
. We really need to have more frank and free discussion of this in the coun=
try. Trump and the anti-Semistism (hate rhetoric and its violent consequenc=
es, like January 6, 2021) are not going away on their own.=20

Thanks for reading this far :)</yt-formatted-string>
